> It is probably easier for you to explore the read.myacc.csv functionality which allows you to tailor GGIR to your own csv file format. Jairo has been working on vignette for this function, but hopefully the standard package documentation can help you for now. Also the unit tests <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/tests/testthat/test_read.myacc.csv.R> with artificial data should be helpful to get you started.
>
> See my responses to your questions in capital letters below.
